message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "qsm-forward: A QSM forward model for simulating BIDS-compliant magnitude and phase MRI"
abstract: >-
  A Python API and CLI for simulating input data for Quantitative Susceptibility
  Mapping (QSM), including BIDS-compliant magnitude and phase MRI and an optional
  chi-separation (paramagnetic/diamagnetic) forward model.
